ow verdict, not evidence and not a Codex tier. No outcome or residual is claimed before execution."},"tokens":[{"i":0,"process":"Position 0 — ⊢: imscriptively bind the source boundary.","concrete":"Use the ququart-factor bind action to initialize the workflow carrier with the independently bound decimal source N, base=2, radix=4, seed=1729, fresh preparation, prepare_seconds=1800, and execute_seconds=120. No decimal source value is present in the request, so N remains an unresolved material binding; it must not be inferred from the 10-glyph program, the target-word length, or either supplied target word.","rationale":"The live position list makes ⊢ the only mark that creates. The built-in IMASM match is therefore evidence for the operator's role, not permission to treat the program as source-numeral data or to flatten the richer target carrier.","input":"Unit workflow carrier and a separate decimal-source binding N, currently unresolved.","output":"Bound carrier containing source=N, base=2, radix=4, seed=1729, fresh-preparation mode, and the preparation/execution budgets; no preparation, readout, or evidence yet.","check":"Before any later action, verify that N is the independently bound decimal source, that the bound source snapshot equals that binding, and that no operation-word glyph has been decoded as a source cell. Execution is pending."},{"i":1,"process":"Position 1 — ≻: perform the forward preparation/readout morphism.","concrete":"At this single ≻ position, compose the ordered native actions [prepare, extract]. Prepare consumes the bound source and produces a validated baked case containing the source, base, radix, seed, Fourier/modular work, and shared-work schedule. Extract then consumes that baked case and produces the actual native readout without a runtime source argument. Because no compatible retained case directory is supplied, fresh preparation is the selected mode; the removed classical producer must not be restored and no period or factor may be 